The '''Golden Dante Statue''' was a structure located in the [[Village]] at {{Coordinates|-17|70|-110}} that appeared when [[Dante]] got elected. It had no use other than being decorative.

== Overview ==
When [[Dante]] got elected, a golden statue of him replaced the well to the right of the [[Community Center]]. The [[Fairy Souls|Fairy Soul]] originally in the well was still accessible through some vines behind the golden statue on the pedestal. During the [[Dante#Boss Fight|Dante fight]], the statue was destroyed and, once Dante was defeated and new [[Mayor Election|Mayors]] were chosen, it was replaced by [[Blood God Shrine]].

== Trivia ==
* Although the statue was guarded by four [[Goons]], it was still accessible without a [[Happy Mask]] or a [[Dante's Talisman]].
* The statue was likely a reference to real-life statues of dictators.
*After the resistance won, it was replaced with the [[Blood God Shrine]].

